 ### Storefront

 The language selector now displays language names with territory, for example "Deutsch (Deutschland)". This applies when the `v6.8.0.0` feature flag is active.
+
+### Core
+
+`CartService::recalculate()` now skips the price rule matcher when the cart holds no line items.
+
+The new `CartRecalculationSkipped` event is dispatched in that case, so a listener can observe the skipped runs.
